    Frontend -->|WebSocket| WS["WebSockets (Channels)"]
    Browser -->|Auth JWT| Auth["Auth Service / JWT"]

    %% Backend infra
    API --> DB[(Postgres DB)]
    API --> Cache[(Redis cache & sessions)]
    API --> Files["Media / Static Storage"]
    API --> Celery["Celery workers"]
    Celery --> DB
    Celery --> Files
    Celery -->|enqueue| Tasks["Background tasks: emails, reports, exports"]

    %% Real-time & bots
    WS --> Chats["Realtime chats consumers"]
    API --> Telegram["Telegram Bot / Messenger"]
    Telegram -->|push\/receive| API

    %% Functional domains
    API --> UsersSvc["Users Service"]
    API --> RolesSvc["Roles & Permissions"]
    API --> CatalogSvc["Catalog: Brands / Materials / Products"]
